### Categories API

@hostname=localhost
@port=5000
@host={{hostname}}:{{port}}
@accessToken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOiIyIiwiaWF0IjoxNzg5MzkxNjkxLCJleHAiOjE3ODkzOTUyOTF9.UiDqhXf8lvpbhvQzRCbOPj37qGEWfjhR1vVph7YG2Ig
@spaceId=2
@categoryId=1

### Create Expense Category
POST http://{{host}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
	"spaceId": {{spaceId}},
	"name": "Groceries",
	"type": "expense",
	"status": "active"
}

### Create Income Category
POST http://{{host}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
	"spaceId": {{spaceId}},
	"name": "Salary",
	"type": "income",
	"status": "active"
}

### Get Categories
GET http://{{host}}/api/categories?spaceId={{spaceId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Search Expense Categories
GET http://{{host}}/api/categories?spaceId={{spaceId}}&type=expense&search=food&page=1&limit=10
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get Category by ID
GET http://{{host}}/api/categories/{{categoryId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Update Category
PATCH http://{{host}}/api/categories/{{categoryId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
	"name": "Food and Groceries",
	"type": "expense",
	"status": "archived"
}

### Delete Category
DELETE http://{{host}}/api/categories/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Validation: Missing Space ID
GET http://{{host}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Validation: Invalid Category Type
POST http://{{host}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
	"spaceId": {{spaceId}},
	"name": "Invalid Category",
	"type": "invalid"
}

### Conflict: Duplicate Category
POST http://{{host}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
	"spaceId": {{spaceId}},
	"name": "Groceries",
	"type": "expense"
}

### Authentication: Missing Token
GET http://{{host}}/api/categories?spaceId={{spaceId}}
Content-Type: application/json
